---
title: "Both arrows send source notes into T"
accTitle: "Capture merge arrow dual"
accDescr: "Greater-than is source-first into an existing destination. Less-than is title-first into a newly created task. Both run the same merge engine and write merged into."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 18
    nodeSpacing: 18
    wrappingWidth: 240
---
flowchart LR
  subgraph GT["Source-first refactor"]
    direction LR
    Sgt["`**Existing S**<br/>@inbox+bench`"]
    Tgt["`**Existing T**<br/>@db+upgrade`"]
    Sgt -->|"S > T"| Tgt
  end
  subgraph LT["Title-first capture"]
    direction LR
    Slt["`**Existing S**<br/>@foo+f @bar+b`"]
    Tlt["`**New T**<br/>title @foo^great`"]
    Slt -->|"T < S"| Tlt
  end
  Tgt -.->|"same engine"| ENG["`**Merge engine**<br/>notes move<br/>S cancelled<br/>merged into`"]
  Tlt -.->|"same engine"| ENG
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  classDef muted fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1F2937
  class Sgt,Slt focus
  class Tgt,Tlt outcome
  class ENG muted
  style GT fill:none,stroke:#3B78C2
  style LT fill:none,stroke:#2E7D4F
